{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna, what's been up? Haven't seen you since we last talked."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-b6652eac06cc215d152a0a1e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:37.502945+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b6652eac06cc215d152a0a1e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b6652eac06cc215d152a0a1e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! I have been revising and perfecting the recipe I made for my family and it turned out really tasty. What's been happening with you?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-a9eab95ddedd5f4c27be93ae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:41.631395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9eab95ddedd5f4c27be93ae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9eab95ddedd5f4c27be93ae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! That's cool. I've been getting so stressed lately because of my tournament progress - tough competitors - but my turtles always cheer me up."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-a73a6071c764ac4953635946", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:45.753142+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a73a6071c764ac4953635946", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a73a6071c764ac4953635946", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Pets have a way of brightening our days. I still have that stuffed animal dog you gave me! I named her Tilly, and she's always with me while I write."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-00f28b3c8c9c4ba9539c0bd6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:49.863738+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "00f28b3c8c9c4ba9539c0bd6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "00f28b3c8c9c4ba9539c0bd6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Glad to hear it! What made you name her Tilly?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-2736ee54433621b8682175ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:54.000478+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2736ee54433621b8682175ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2736ee54433621b8682175ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I used to have a dog back in Michigan with that name, but then I got allergic and we had to get rid of her. The name helps me remember her back when I used to be able to hold and squeeze animal without an allergic reaction!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-b49e0dcb37266941a1c93e22", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:31:58.143282+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b49e0dcb37266941a1c93e22", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b49e0dcb37266941a1c93e22", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's so touching! Glad the stuffed animal means so much!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-1f4942f3ae5bf4cb258b1ca2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:02.241116+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1f4942f3ae5bf4cb258b1ca2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1f4942f3ae5bf4cb258b1ca2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Tilly helps me stay focused and brings me so much joy. It's amazing how even stuffed animals can do that!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-aebe1a808c9bf8d236bb0d56", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:06.351072+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aebe1a808c9bf8d236bb0d56", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aebe1a808c9bf8d236bb0d56", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: It really is, I'm not sure I'll ever understand why watching my turtles slowly walk around makes me so happy. But I'm very glad it does."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-5c6fe96fb673ba47ce1616a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:10.473400+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5c6fe96fb673ba47ce1616a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5c6fe96fb673ba47ce1616a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Same here! So have you been up to anything recenly?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-a797a6f17923c326d163847c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:14.596997+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a797a6f17923c326d163847c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a797a6f17923c326d163847c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yeah, I've just been practicing for my next video game tournemant. How about you?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-1ae2b350b10535ebbdceceab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:18.708091+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ae2b350b10535ebbdceceab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ae2b350b10535ebbdceceab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Well, I had a bit of a setback recently - another rejection from a production company."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-cae47412c7b63db1e3ab1f28", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:22.832955+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cae47412c7b63db1e3ab1f28", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cae47412c7b63db1e3ab1f28", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Bummer, Joanna. Is this the one you sent to a film contest? Rejections suck, but don't forget they don't define you. Keep at it and you'll find the perfect opportunity."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-bd4d581eb90ba37417d31aa6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:26.978477+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd4d581eb90ba37417d31aa6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd4d581eb90ba37417d31aa6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah.. Thanks, Nate. It's hard, but I won't let it slow me down. I'm gonna keep grinding and moving ahead."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-fc2c8f71e06ab7f56904df82", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:31.100201+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc2c8f71e06ab7f56904df82", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc2c8f71e06ab7f56904df82", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's what I like to hear! I really respect you for that and being able to bounce back whenever something sad happens!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-e552d1e5c479d60243b0437a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:35.236365+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e552d1e5c479d60243b0437a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e552d1e5c479d60243b0437a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Your encouragement really means a lot. I'm gonna keep pushing forward and believing in myself."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-30abda5171dd2b5b794f1f2d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:39.362402+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "30abda5171dd2b5b794f1f2d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "30abda5171dd2b5b794f1f2d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: You got this, and don't ever forget that you have people cheering you on from the sidelines wherever you go."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-170ebddb860bf44bacfe6e3b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:43.487535+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "170ebddb860bf44bacfe6e3b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "170ebddb860bf44bacfe6e3b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks! I'll see you around!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-b9ee76224308d887283c8c20", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:47.613183+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9ee76224308d887283c8c20", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9ee76224308d887283c8c20", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: No problem! Catch you later!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_24-81eb25e2e272e7beab607d59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:32:51.740502+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "81eb25e2e272e7beab607d59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "81eb25e2e272e7beab607d59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
